From 391e651e55b9df24e78a72ba8a9968e916fe8fa8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:04:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Documentation of the generic-parallel interfaces updated

Page of the generic-parallel interface for behaviours built and added to
the menu, states of the batches, statuses, queues of each backend,
configuration files delivered with TFEL, rules for the code blocks of
the isotropic DSLs. Page of the material properties aligned with the
version 2 of the generated functions (execution options, asynchronous
evaluation, statuses, out-of-order SYCL queues, threads per block).
Release notes completed (behaviours on GPUs, incompatibilities, new
features of TFEL/Math, TFEL/Utilities and TFEL/Material, other fixes).
Pages of the generic interface, of TFEL/Config, of the keywords
@SharedData, @InitializeFunction, @CompareToNumericalJacobian and
@Profiling, and of the polycrystal tutorials updated.
